sshdeploy (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * deployweb: redesign CLI for explicit SSH/web settings and multi-server
    virtual-host bindings.
  * docs: refresh README and deployweb(1) for the new deployweb options and
    config keys.
  * bash-completion: update deployweb option/value completion for renamed and
    newly added flags.

